{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1467780/extras/699d264f1b80dce2c656738318aa3ee1.poster.avif?t=1763089672\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1467780/extras/699d264f1b80dce2c656738318aa3ee1.webm?t=1763089672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1467780/extras/699d264f1b80dce2c656738318aa3ee1.mp4?t=1763089672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY &amp; FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>30 minutes of story</li><li>A linear visual novel</li><li>Full Japanese voice acting by seasoned professionals</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2>Children pay karma for the sins of their parents,<br>born to bear a contorted cross.<br><br>Tokyo\u20142 AM, the witching hour.<br>Under the new moon, two identical girls face off.<br>Their improvised weapons look out of place in their hands.<br>Behind them stand two strange men, garbed all in black.<br><br>What do these men want? What are these girls\u2019 dreams?<br>And what is it they're fighting for?<br><br><i>Gather round, now, don't be shy!</i><br><i>It's a dark festival beneath a black sky...</i><br><i>So, candles out\u2014let's start the bout!</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHARACTER</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1467780/extras/5e519398e27cfc2adbe43bf581fbde91.avif?t=1763089672\" alt=\"Kikyo Hirosoma (Voice: Shiho Nakaya)\" width=616 height=231 /></span><br><br>Shinku Hirosoma\u2019s \u201colder\u201d sister. Gentle, calm, naive and easy-going. <br>She is on bad terms with Shinku.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1467780/extras/adc166daa46d6c0bf01811abce5796c1.avif?t=1763089672\" alt=\"Shinku Hirosoma (Voice: Naho Nakaya)\" width=616 height=231 /></span><br><br>Kikyo Hirosoma\u2019s \u201colder\u201d sister. Always wears an irritated expression. <br>She is on bad terms with Kikyo.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1467780/extras/aecd9a81b0bb962c4395e842caf38710.avif?t=1763089672\" alt=\"Awasumi Yamaga (Voice: Pile Bunker)\" width=616 height=231 /></span><br><br>A suspicious man wrapped in bandages with old-fashioned speech. <br>Surprisingly, he may be quite capable with household chores...<br>Closely acquainted with Tsukishiro.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1467780/extras/6f61018064477ba3a589798432488e1c.avif?t=1763089672\" alt=\"Tsukishiro Tsukishiro (Voice: Mikado Sumeragi)\" width=616 height=231 /></span><br><br>A suspicious man with long hair who works at night.<br>He seems to be clumsy with household chores...<br>Closely acquainted with Awasumi.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1467780?t=1763089672","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1467780/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763089672","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1467780/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763089672","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1467780/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763089672","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Contains occasional crude humor. All love interests are 18 years of age or older."},"detailed_description":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_